    "en": "“He’s separating self and world completely,” Nei-chan analyzes. “That’s why the idea of the self continuing eternally becomes a prison.”",
    "ja": "渋谷の光が低く脈打つ。運河の風。Nei-chanが小さく鈴音を鳴らした。"
